---
// Roadmap.astro - 1:1 migration from Next.js Roadmap.tsx
---
<section
  id="roadmap"
  class="py-24 md:py-32 border-b border-[var(--siduri-border-subtle)] bg-[#0b0b0e]"
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    {/* Section Header */}
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-[var(--siduri-border-ember)] bg-[var(--siduri-tint-low)] text-[var(--siduri-ember-light)] text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">
        08 · Project Roadmap
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-normal font-serif-title text-[var(--siduri-text-primary)] mb-5">
        The Living Horizon
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--siduri-text-secondary)] font-sans leading-relaxed font-light mb-6">
        Siduri is in active, disciplined open-source development. We clearly
        separate what is verified today from our upcoming architectural milestones.
      </p>

      <div class="inline-flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-950/20 text-left text-xs font-sans text-amber-200/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <span class="font-mono text-amber-400 select-none">⚠</span>
        <span>
          <strong class="font-mono text-amber-300 uppercase tracking-wide">Notice:</strong> Siduri is currently in an experimental development phase with breaking changes expected. While organ unit tests and packaging invariants pass, the system is <strong>untested at real-world end-to-end (E2E) scale</strong> across diverse physical hardware.
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Two Column Milestone Grid */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      {/* Available Now */}
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--siduri-border-ember)] bg-[#101015] shadow-xl">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 mb-6 border-b border-[var(--siduri-border-subtle)]">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[var(--siduri-online)] uppercase tracking-wider">
            ● Progressing Baseline (Ready to Test)
          </span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[var(--siduri-text-dim)]">
            Experimental Scaffold
          </span>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--siduri-text-secondary)]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[var(--siduri-online)] font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-[var(--siduri-text-primary)] block font-medium">
                10 Canonical Organs Distributed
              </strong>
              <span class="text-xs text-[var(--siduri-text-muted)] font-light">
                Independently published @siduri-x/* packages with zero-bundling ESM resolution.
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[var(--siduri-online)] font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-[var(--siduri-text-primary)] block font-medium">
                Interactive CLI Generator (@vxnus/siduri)
              </strong>
              <span class="text-xs text-[var(--siduri-text-muted)] font-light">
                Dynamic organ manifest discovery, zero-config SQLite bootstrapping, and doctor health probes.
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[var(--siduri-online)] font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-[var(--siduri-text-primary)] block font-medium">
                Pure SQLite Foundation (siduri.sqlite)
              </strong>
              <span class="text-xs text-[var(--siduri-text-muted)] font-light">
                Zero-config local database with WAL mode and built-in FTS5 BM25 search. PostgreSQL fully eradicated.
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[var(--siduri-online)] font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-[var(--siduri-text-primary)] block font-medium">
                Memory Truth Gate &amp; Sovereign Life DB
              </strong>
              <span class="text-xs text-[var(--siduri-text-muted)] font-light">
                Staged PENDING proposals, explicit approvals, and structured Life DB (@siduri-x/knowledge) for inventory, finances, and schedules.
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[var(--siduri-online)] font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-[var(--siduri-text-primary)] block font-medium">
                3 Interaction Modes &amp; LLM-Native Self
              </strong>
              <span class="text-xs text-[var(--siduri-text-muted)] font-light">
                Casual (Zero Drift), Teach (HITL Staged Review), and Hybrid modes with 4-tier resolution, alongside qualitative relational stances (affinity, trust, dynamic posture).
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[var(--siduri-online)] font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-[var(--siduri-text-primary)] block font-medium">
                Embodiment &amp; Voice Synthesis
              </strong>
              <span class="text-xs text-[var(--siduri-text-muted)] font-light">
                Live2D Cubism WebGL avatar state machine with queued Edge-TTS / Piper / VOICEVOX speech and Mouth SSE streaming.
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Coming Soon */}
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--siduri-border-subtle)] bg-[#0e0e13]">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 mb-6 border-b border-[var(--siduri-border-subtle)]">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[var(--siduri-ember)] uppercase tracking-wider">
            ✦ Coming Soon (Next Milestones)
          </span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[var(--siduri-text-dim)]">
            Active Architecture Milestones
          </span>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--siduri-text-secondary)]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[var(--siduri-ember)] font-bold mt-0.5">↳</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-[var(--siduri-text-primary)] block font-medium">
                Live Real-World E2E Test Suite
              </strong>
              <span class="text-xs text-[var(--siduri-text-muted)] font-light">
                Graduating from mock unit tests to continuous real-hardware audio capture, live WebGL rendering benchmarks, and multi-week persistent memory drift analysis.
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[var(--siduri-ember)] font-bold mt-0.5">↳</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-[var(--siduri-text-primary)] block font-medium">
                Automated Life Database Sync Connectors
              </strong>
              <span class="text-xs text-[var(--siduri-text-muted)] font-light">
                Automated sync adapters for game account rosters (Genshin, Star Rail), banking ledgers, and Obsidian vaults.
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[var(--siduri-ember)] font-bold mt-0.5">↳</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-[var(--siduri-text-primary)] block font-medium">
                Distributed Multi-Machine Topology
              </strong>
              <span class="text-xs text-[var(--siduri-text-muted)] font-light">
                Run GPU-heavy Vision and Voice organs on a local homelab workstation while running Brain on a laptop.
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[var(--siduri-ember)] font-bold mt-0.5">↳</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-[var(--siduri-text-primary)] block font-medium">
                Performance &amp; Reliability Benchmarking Suite
              </strong>
              <span class="text-xs text-[var(--siduri-text-muted)] font-light">
                Automated latency budgets, SQLite FTS5 scaling benchmarks, and memory compaction stress testing.
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[var(--siduri-ember)] font-bold mt-0.5">↳</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-[var(--siduri-text-primary)] block font-medium">
                Community Organ Registry
              </strong>
              <span class="text-xs text-[var(--siduri-text-muted)] font-light">
                Directory for third-party organ plugins and verified Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool integrations.
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[var(--siduri-ember)] font-bold mt-0.5">↳</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-[var(--siduri-text-primary)] block font-medium">
                Local RVC Voice Cloning Pipeline
              </strong>
              <span class="text-xs text-[var(--siduri-text-muted)] font-light">
                Integrated post-processing converter for training and inferencing custom acoustic models locally.
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
